      "doc_id": "doc_1_1980",
      "doc_title": "Pathfinder 2e Remaster Core Rules.txt",
      "chunk_id": 2,
      "text": "2. Multiple Attack Penalty (MAP):\n        The first Strike in a round is at full attack bonus.\n        The second Strike incurs a -5 penalty (-4 if the weapon has the Agile trait, such as Dagger or Fist).\n        The third Strike incurs a -10 penalty (-8 if the weapon has the Agile trait).\n        3. Shield Block Reaction:",
