    {
      "doc_id": "doc_1_1980",
      "doc_title": "Pathfinder 2e Remaster Core Rules.txt",
      "chunk_id": 3,
      "text": "3. Shield Block Reaction:\n        Requires the character to have used the Raise a Shield action earlier that round.\n        When hit with physical damage, the shield's Hardness (e.g., Hardness 5 for a Steel Shield) reduces the damage taken.\n        Both the character and the shield take any excess damage.\n        4. Four Degrees of Success:",
